1. Introduction

Welcome to NexGen BD Ultra ("the App"), developed by MR SPEED STUDIO ("we", "our", or "us").

We respect your privacy and are committed to protecting your information. This Privacy Policy explains how information may be accessed, collected, used, stored, and shared when you use NexGen BD Ultra.

By using the App, you acknowledge this Privacy Policy.

2. Information We May Process

Depending on the features you use, the App may process the following information:

A. Information stored on your device

- Baki Khata records and transaction details entered by you.
- Daily Islamic Mission progress and streak information.
- App preferences, language settings, and notification preferences.
- Local app data and saved content.

B. Information submitted to AI features
When you use AI-powered features, such as caption generation or image and video analysis, the text, images, videos, or prompts you choose to submit may be transmitted to Google Firebase AI Logic and the configured Google Gemini AI service to generate responses.

Please avoid submitting passwords, payment details, or other sensitive personal information through AI features.

C. Advertising information
The App may use Google AdMob to display advertisements. AdMob may process device identifiers, advertising-related information, approximate location signals, and usage information as permitted by your device settings and applicable Google policies.

D. Purchase information
If you purchase Stars, Google Play processes the payment. We may access purchase-related information, such as product identifiers, purchase status, and transaction tokens, to verify purchases and credit Stars.

We do not directly collect or store your full payment card details.

3. How We Use Information

Information may be processed to:

- Provide and maintain app features.
- Generate AI responses and content.
- Save your local records and preferences.
- Manage Stars, purchases, and transaction history.
- Display advertisements.
- Improve app stability, security, and performance.
- Respond to privacy or support requests.

4. Data Storage

NexGen BD Ultra supports Guest Mode and does not require mandatory account registration.

Information saved locally, including Baki Khata records and mission progress, is stored on your device where supported.

If you uninstall the App or clear its storage, locally stored information may be permanently lost unless you have exported a backup.

Information submitted to third-party services may be processed or retained according to those services' respective privacy policies.

